Postern for postmarketOS -- branding assets
============================================

This directory holds Postern branding assets (wallpaper, icons) referenced
by /etc/postern/branding.conf. It is EMPTY of binary assets in the scaffold;
drop real files here and point branding.conf at them before shipping.

Hard rule (../../../etc/motd, ../../HONESTY.md): branding must always read as
"Postern for postmarketOS", never "Postern OS". Do NOT overwrite pmOS's
/etc/os-release, boot splash, or any surface that would imply this is a
distribution or an attestable image. This is the lower-trust, non-attestable
tier and is not covered by the Postern Seal.
